;;
;; Domain:     bamidelealy.com.
;; Purpose:    Custom apex for the GitHub Pages site at
;;             https://github.com/sebastienrousseau/bamidelealy.github.io.
;; Exported:   2026-05-18
;;
;; Apex A/AAAA records point at GitHub Pages' anycast endpoints (see
;; https://docs.github.com/en/pages/configuring-a-custom-domain-for-your-github-pages-site).
;; The www subdomain is a CNAME to the canonical GitHub Pages host so
;; both apex and www resolve to the same origin without renaming the repo.
;;
;; Records are proxied through Cloudflare (orange cloud) so HSTS, the
;; edge TLS termination, the bot rules and the cache all stay in front
;; of GitHub Pages.
;;
;; CAA locks public-cert issuance to the two CAs GitHub Pages currently
;; uses (Let's Encrypt via DigiCert, plus Sectigo for fallback). The
;; iodef line is the contact reported to a CA when an unauthorised
;; issuance is attempted.
;;

;; NS Records (Cloudflare-assigned)
bamidelealy.com.	86400	IN	NS	ines.ns.cloudflare.com.
bamidelealy.com.	86400	IN	NS	ivan.ns.cloudflare.com.

;; A Records (proxied, GitHub Pages apex IPs)
bamidelealy.com.	1	IN	A	185.199.108.153 ; cf_tags=cf-proxied:true
bamidelealy.com.	1	IN	A	185.199.109.153 ; cf_tags=cf-proxied:true
bamidelealy.com.	1	IN	A	185.199.110.153 ; cf_tags=cf-proxied:true
bamidelealy.com.	1	IN	A	185.199.111.153 ; cf_tags=cf-proxied:true

;; AAAA Records (proxied, GitHub Pages apex IPv6)
bamidelealy.com.	1	IN	AAAA	2606:50c0:8000::153 ; cf_tags=cf-proxied:true
bamidelealy.com.	1	IN	AAAA	2606:50c0:8001::153 ; cf_tags=cf-proxied:true
bamidelealy.com.	1	IN	AAAA	2606:50c0:8002::153 ; cf_tags=cf-proxied:true
bamidelealy.com.	1	IN	AAAA	2606:50c0:8003::153 ; cf_tags=cf-proxied:true

;; CNAME Record (proxied)
www.bamidelealy.com.	1	IN	CNAME	sebastienrousseau.github.io. ; cf_tags=cf-proxied:true

;; CAA Records — restrict cert issuance to Let's Encrypt (GitHub Pages)
;;                and Sectigo (fallback), and tell unauthorised CAs where
;;                to report attempted misissuance.
bamidelealy.com.	86400	IN	CAA	0 issue "letsencrypt.org"
bamidelealy.com.	86400	IN	CAA	0 issue "sectigo.com"
bamidelealy.com.	86400	IN	CAA	0 issuewild ";"
bamidelealy.com.	86400	IN	CAA	0 iodef "mailto:security@bamidelealy.com"
